cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaLuck: Risk Measurement and Performance Benchmarks in a Live LLM Trading Competition"
abstract: >-
  Five standalone Quantlets reproducing descriptive risk profiles, risk-return
  associations, accounting attribution, paired denominator sensitivities and
  conditional frozen-position stress calculations from minimal derived inputs.
  This package does not rebuild the original transaction ledger. The short
  unreplicated design does not establish persistent model skill; historical
  liquidation feasibility remains unverified.
type: software
